#!/usr/bin/env python3
# Generated by runa via A2A Mesh delegation
"""
Session DB: SQLite → PG (mesh-wide online status)

Migrates per-node SQLite session storage to PostgreSQL so that
all mesh nodes share a single session table. This enables
mesh-wide online status: when a user logs in on Runa's dashboard,
Nova (and every other node) can see the WS connection state via
_broadcast_session_update.

This module provides:
  - PgSessionStore: PostgreSQL-backed session store (replaces SQLite)
  - SessionManager: high-level create/validate/destroy + online status
  - SQLite migration helper (reads existing ~/.hermes/mesh_users.db
    and imports sessions into PG)
  - A standalone HTTP+WS server for testing mesh-wide online status

Run from repo root:
    python session_pg.py
"""

